Mike: That's right. And we have to finish our project by Monday. I'm so worried! || 迈克：没错，我们必须周一之前完成项目，我特别担心！
Chen Jie: Why not do both? I can help. We can work together. || 陈杰：为什么两个活动都做呢？我可以帮忙，我们一起完成。
Mike: That's a good idea! || 迈克：好主意！
Part B
Miss White: What's the matter, John? You look worried. || 怀特老师：约翰，你怎么了？你看起来忧心忡忡。
John: It's about our project. Mike and I want to do different things. || 约翰：是项目的事，我和迈克想做不同的活动。
Miss White: I see. It's important to listen to each other. || 怀特老师：我懂了，互相倾听对方的想法很重要。
John: Yes, Miss White. I need to talk to Mike. But I'm afraid he's angry with me. || 约翰：是的怀特老师，我想和迈克谈谈，可我怕他生我的气。
Miss White: Look, here he comes. You can talk to him now. || 怀特老师：你看，他过来了，你现在可以和他聊聊。
Mike: John, I'm sorry. Let's do both projects! Chen Jie can work with us. || 迈克：约翰，对不起，我们两个项目都参加吧！陈杰可以和我们一起。
John: That's great! || 约翰：太好了！
                    
                    
                    
